    "title": "Warsaw Man Arrested on Multiple Drug Charges - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By America Today Staff ,\n17 hours ago A traffic stop near Silver Lake led to the arrest of 44-year-old Anthony Wayne Miller of Warsaw on several drug- and driving-related charges. Police stopped Miller on Nov. 21 after a Silver Lake officer saw his vehicle cross the center line several times and noticed a broken license plate light. Court documents say the officer learned Miller’s license was suspended. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
